@host = http://localhost:5240

### 1. Register a website: expected 201. Copy id to projectId below.
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "websiteUrl": "https://example.com"
}

### Paste the id from the response here.
@projectId = db731e50-44c5-40cd-b6a8-11862dc53c99

### 2. Read the project: expected 200 after replacing projectId.
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}

### 3. Select the audit parameters: expected 200.
PUT {{host}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/audit-parameters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "wcagVersion": "2.2"
}

### 4. Unsupported version: expected 422, attemptedVersion: 3.0.
PUT {{host}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/audit-parameters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "wcagVersion": "3.0"
}

### 5. Import a capture: expected 201. No website is downloaded by this endpoint.
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/captures
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dom": "<html lang=\"pl\"><body><h1>Test audytu</h1></body></html>",
  "screenshotReferences": ["screenshots/home.png"]
}

### 6. Empty DOM: expected 422.
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/captures
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dom": "",
  "screenshotReferences": []
}

### 7. Initial dashboard read model: expected 200.
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/dashboard

### 8. Invalid website address: expected 400.
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "websiteUrl": "to nie jest adres strony"
}

### 9. Missing project: expected 404.
GET {{host}}/api/projects/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
